This folder contains code and documentation derived from ai-cookbook by Dave Ebbelaar:
https://github.com/daveebbelaar/ai-cookbook/tree/main/mcp/crash-course

- 1-server-setup/, 2-openai-sample/, 3-mcp-vs-function-calling/ and
  4-mcp-with-docker/ (Python files, data/kb.json and the Dockerfile):
  copied or adapted from mcp/crash-course/3-simple-server-setup to
  6-run-with-docker.
- README.md: most of the text after the introduction comes from the READMEs
  of mcp/crash-course (2-understanding-mcp to 7-lifecycle-management).

